      aliases: ["Glucotrol", "Glucotrol XL", "glipizid", "glipizide ER", "second generation sulfonylurea"],
      brandExamples: ["Glucotrol", "Glucotrol XL"],
      class: "Second-generation sulfonylurea insulin secretagogue; pancreatic SUR1/KATP-channel blocker",
