      interactions: ["Strong P-gp/CYP3A4 inducers such as rifampin can reduce linagliptin exposure and efficacy; an alternative may be needed.", "Insulin and sulfonylureas add hypoglycemia.", "Its nonrenal clearance distinguishes it from sitagliptin, but drug interactions and clinical tolerance still matter."],
      keyLabs: ["A1c and glucose pattern", "Renal function for disease management rather than routine linagliptin dose adjustment", "Pancreatitis, skin, joint, heart-failure, and hypersensitivity assessment"],
