      populationRisks: populationRisks("Use only within current age/indication labeling and monitor growth, glucose, and hypoglycemia with combinations.", "Nonrenal elimination can be useful, but heart-failure and skin/joint adverse effects can present atypically.", "Pregnancy and lactation evidence is limited; use an individualized diabetes-in-pregnancy plan."),
