      keyLabs: ["Weight/BMI and percent response at each dose checkpoint", "Pregnancy test before and monthly; bicarbonate, potassium, creatinine/eGFR, glucose", "Pulse/BP, mood/suicidality, cognition, eye symptoms, hydration/sweating, and kidney-stone history"],
